                <pb facs="0737" n="1697" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1697"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 845.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Phelps to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-11-07"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 7,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Phelps states that the Sackville correspondence was published in England on
                    the preceding day and suggests the withholdment of publication by the United
                    States for the present moment.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
